      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1763922975264,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "diskStorage → Saves uploaded files to server disk with customizable folder and\nfilename.",
      "fontSize": 22.18263299425713,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "diskStorage → Saves uploaded files to server disk with customizable folder and filename.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "p7j7EvNdTD6P6Xr6gG1J3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2423.2826408079077,
      "y": -2196.9065494055667,
      "width": 783.9513635717984,
      "height": 55.456582485642826,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0O",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 103068356,
      "version": 283,
      "versionNonce": 1716894148,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1763922975264,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "memoryStorage → Stores files in RAM as Buffer objects (temporary, not\npersisted).",
      "fontSize": 22.18263299425713,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "memoryStorage → Stores files in RAM as Buffer objects (temporary, not persisted).",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "OWkhiykPJ-LN56BA0Zr-Q",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2426.8512593558644,
      "y": -2086.0814689846634,
      "width": 842.9349088839817,
      "height": 55.456582485642826,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0P",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1640483708,
      "version": 260,
      "versionNonce": 981590340,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1763922975264,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Custom storage engine → You can define your own storage behavior, e.g., save\nfiles to cloud (S3, Firebase) or database directly.",
      "fontSize": 22.18263299425713,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Custom storage engine → You can define your own storage behavior, e.g., save files to cloud (S3, Firebase) or database directly.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "D7mk5dCYjxEQYMua9nIPi",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2450.7475355987626,
      "y": -2347.6151859849547,
      "width": 901.5894807269824,
      "height": 29.9205511369252,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0Q",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 957890044,
      "version": 199,
      "versionNonce": 289211388,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1763922961202,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Multer has these three options when it comes to where to store the files :--",
      "fontSize": 23.93644090954016,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Multer has these three options when it comes to where to store the files :--",
